    },
    "After you stop, this temporary recording is sent to Doubao for transcription. The words stay editable here and are not sent to the Agent until you tap Send. Talent Signal deletes its temporary audio after the response; provider handling follows your service agreement." : {
      "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "停止录音后，这段临时音频会发送给豆包进行转写。文字会先留在输入框中供你编辑，只有点击发送后才会交给 Agent。Talent Signal 会在收到响应后删除本地临时音频；服务商如何处理数据以你的服务协议为准。" } } }
    },
    "Connect a workspace to use voice input." : {
      "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "连接工作区后即可使用语音输入。" } } }
    },
